  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_tunny_cb3dbaf45c5c01a274463a8019fcb76c66d5b4f51dad9527e68dc91d638d5f0d28">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a scombroid fish of the genus Orcynus, especially the common tunny, O. thynnus, fished from ancient times in the Mediterranean and Atlantic; one of the largest food-fishes, often reaching ten feet (OED s.v. tunny)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
